  "sourceBoundary": "Normal REQUESTING/LISTENING/FINISHING/fallback states and explicitly restored original voice supply product-copy keys. ImportedVoiceReceiptOnly is a typed local failure. Arbitrary CodexCommandError/OS text remains literal; a synthetic external error equal to product key复制 stays复制 in English instead of becoming Copy. Known key is cleared on new operation/finish/reset and checked against current error.",
  "nativeInteraction": "Real typed import -> fresh MobileSession.restore -> production AgentHubApp/VoiceInputController/VoiceInputStrip. Controlled allowed callback and synthetic deferred receipt; no microphone prompt. Busy control disabled and second finish produces no extra query; awaiting original audio fails receipt-only without prepare/upload. Second original query returns external literal; cancel keeps original draft and audio/metadata, no transcript applied.",
  "visualReview": "24 PixelCopy owned-activity images retained. Eight receipt-only windows and API26 English-light busy window manually inspected; status bounds fully within panel, actions readable, original mixed text unchanged. Actual content theme is verified via production AgentHubApp callback; these tests do not verify MainActivity system-bar callback integration. API26 portrait1080x1920, physical portrait1080x2340; default fontScale1. Physical font differs from API26; configuration cause not asserted. Full font/rotation/AX and system UI matrix remains open.",
  "catalogExaminer": "Removed stale fixed1699 count and1661 proof number; uses frozen current catalog keys/count and compares every compiled resource in both languages, plus literal runtime parameters.1749 keys/language passed on both environments; no product dictionary shortened.",
  "otherObservedUi": "English connection caption still shows raw Chinese in synthetic connecting state. Empty-state English subtitle is near viewport edge; clipping is not proven without text-layout evidence. Recorded as separate P6/UI matrix followup, not hidden or claimed fixed.",
  "iosImpact": "Matches iOS product-owned localization versus external text, busy/retained-original and no-replay assertions. iOS source/device unchanged in this phase and A6 paused. Full voice/migration UI and voice-directory migration gap remain open.",
  "bounds": "Native fixture component/session scenarios only; no new Electron/model/microphone, system file migration page, full quota/provisional/child/provider or complete parity pass. P7 full migration remains active.",
